    "Monika frowns and looks down at her computer."
    m "Club president. Right."
    "As I move to set up the printer, I look up at Monika and can tell she's acting a bit different now."
    mc "Uh, okay. I got everything set up. Mind if I get it connected to your computer."
    m "Yeah. Here you go."
    "She hands me her laptop and I go through and install the printer."
    "When the test page comes out, I hand her back the laptop and she starts pulling up the pamphlets."
    "I lean over to take a peak as she's getting everything ready and she glances over at me."
