    m "Hmm? Oh. Yeah. "
    m "It's just weird how this printer is the sound I was looking for. "
    m "Well, the rhythm at least."
    m "I don't see myself making THAT kind of techno music."
    mc "Heh. That's cool. Even in the mundane you find something worthy."
