    "Monika starts to blush a bit."
    m "Sucking up to your president I see..."
    mc "No, just wanting to support a friend."
    "That makes Monika pause and slowly smile."
    m "Well, I don't share my music with anyone. It is quite personal, you know."
    "I look over to her and our eyes meet."
    m "Good thing you make the cut."
    "She winks at me. I smile back at her. "
    "As I start thinking about the song and what lyrics would go with it, I pause as the words from her lyric sheet I found come to mind. "
