    mc "And thank you. For taking care of Sayori all this time. You have no idea how much that means to me."
    m "Trust me. I do."
    "We both smile at each other as we continue working on the last of the handouts."
    m "Alright! That looks like it's it. Thank you again for having me [player]. I can't imagine the headache this would have been doing at the library."
    mc "Anything I can do to help out, I'm there."
